# The Rain Engine (CIPlay the_rain_engine): the plan The Rainmakers' finale, quest "The Rain Engine"
# The Foot (0 -60, 3 m) with the salt caves west of it (-26 -61) and the lift; the crown (28 m) with the four arms on their
# spurs (N 0 34, E 34 0, S 24 -24, W -34 0), the master board (0 -6), the drum hall (-20 0), the laser court (-9..6 8..18)
# and the Heart (6 -4, its door west).
island The Rain Engine
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Rain Engine
wait 5
